	(text "Note: Place pulldown resistors R301, R302, R303 as close\nto their respective pin on the motor driver as possible so\nthe inputs stay at a defined low level and are less \nsusceptible to noise along the trace."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.558 110.236 0)
